] [17592186445532 1069 "q-690" 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445532 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445532 1071 "$a+2b+2a-b=$" 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445532 1072 #uuid "59eaa740-2224-50f3-a29a-b209a5484302" 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445532 1074 "First, we group the like terms.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a+2b+2a-b & = \\\\ {{a+2a}_{⏟}}_{a\\text{ terms}}+{{2b-b}_{⏟}}_{b\\text{ terms}} & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we combine the like terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a+2a}_{⏟}+{2b-b}_{⏟} & = \\\\ (1+2)a+(2-1)b & = \\\\ 3a+b\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445533 1068 #edb/ref 17592186445527 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445533 1069 "q-154824" 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445533 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445533 1071 "$8t-6t+2t+5=$" 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445533 1072 #uuid "725776b1-8aa4-5bb5-85d2-8cf2d39bf5c8" 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445533 1074 "We have three like terms, $8t,$ $-6t,$ and $2t.$ \n\nTo collect these like terms, we combine them into a single term, adding their coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8t-6t+2t+5 & = \\\\ (8-6+2)t+5 & = \\\\ 4t+5\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445534 1068 #edb/ref 17592186445526 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445534 1068 #edb/ref 17592186445528 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445534 1069 "q-173710" 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445534 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445534 1071 "$8a+3b+11a=${{field-1}}\n$a\\,+$\n{{field-2}}\n$b$" 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445534 1072 #uuid "77366c00-a15b-5f37-b0cb-471f787df0a0" 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445534 1074 "We rearrange the terms so that the like terms, $8a$ and $11a$, are together.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8a+3b+11a & = \\\\ {{8a+11a}_{⏟}}_{a\\text{ terms}}+3b & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we combine the like terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{8a+11a}_{⏟}\\,+\\,3b & = \\\\ (8+11)a+3b & = \\\\ 19\\,a+3\\,b\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445535 1068 #edb/ref 17592186445519 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445535 1068 #edb/ref 17592186445520 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445535 1068 #edb/ref 17592186445529 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445535 1069 "q-178261" 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445535 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445535 1071 "$2x+4y+5x-2y-4=${{field-1}}\n$x\\,+$\n{{field-2}}\n$y\\,-$\n{{field-3}}" 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445535 1072 #uuid "7905141b-131b-5e75-9f8a-02832316e158" 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445535 1074 "First, we group the like terms.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x+4y+5x-2y-4 & = \\\\ {{2x+5x}_{⏟}}_{x\\text{ terms}}+{{4y-2y}_{⏟}}_{y\\text{ terms}}-4 & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we combine the like terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{2x+5x}_{⏟}\\,+\\,{4y-2y}_{⏟}\\,-\\,4 & = \\\\ (2+5)x+(4-2)y-4 & = \\\\ 7\\,x+2\\,y-4 & \\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445536 1068 #edb/ref 17592186445518 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445536 1068 #edb/ref 17592186445523 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445536 1069 "q-178228" 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445536 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445536 1071 "$2x+7x+2z=${{field-1}}\n$x\\,+$\n{{field-2}}$z$" 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445536 1072 #uuid "99943b2d-800d-508e-b6fa-b967f1e637ef" 13194139534954 17592186045417 true] [17592186445536 1074 "We have two like terms, $2x$ and $7x.$ \n\nTo collect these like terms, we combine them into a single term, adding their coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x+7x+2z & = \\\\